- The "Kaggle dataset" is located at `~/icecube_kaggle` and has the following tree structure, which contains both the original Parquet files and the memory-mapped files. This dataset is further described in [kaggle-dataset-description.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/kaggle-dataset-description.mdc).
